Z||000006||Songman||11-21-2000||02:07 PM||||Can't be 69 Firebird. 69 Firebird has square wheel archs.<P>It is based on a 69 GTO. Notice the rocker trim and door crease, and the area in front of the wheels. Round marker lights and the typical GTO curve into the front pan. This car even has a version of the Judge stripe on it.<P>Although you can't see these areas in the picture, I have a picture of my 69 Judge at <A HREF="http://members.home.com/dalehouston/home.html." TARGET=_blank>http://members.home.com/dalehouston/home.html</A> <p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 11-21-2000).]||||reg||14
