Z||000008||FNXRISING||11-22-2000||04:44 AM||||Thank you, for pointing that out!  I own an '81 Delorean, and was thrilled when I bought my '68 Firebird (which is now unfortunately for sale) and found out that it was the same, man, John Delorean, who designed it, too, years earlier! In fact, the "ironing board" shape on the hood was his idea... <P>And now I am in the process of getting another Pontiac, an '88 Fiero GT in yellow!<P>Woohoo!<P>fnxrising||||reg||1
